cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Marmot in your research, please cite the version you used."
type: software
title: "Marmot: MAteRialMOdellingToolbox"
abstract: >-
  Marmot (MAteRialMOdellingToolbox) is a C++ library for robust and efficient finite elements and
  state-of-the-art constitutive models, especially for quasi-brittle materials such as concrete, rock and soils.
  It provides generic interfaces for solvers including Abaqus, Plaxis, MOOSE, OpenSees and EdelweissFE.
